$ jailops image delete -y freebsd-15
! image_in_use: image "freebsd-15" is used by jail "web"
! hint: Upgrade or delete the jails listed in the message, then retry. (jailops explain image_in_use)
[exit 5]

$ jailops image delete -y alpine-3
image/alpine-3 deleted

$ jailops jail delete -y web
jail/web deleted

$ jailops image delete -y freebsd-15
image/freebsd-15 deleted

